{{loot row|item=Flametal Protection Idol |amt=1 |rate=1.44%}}
{{loot row|item=Flametal Battle Idol |amt=1 |rate=1.44%}}
}}


== Notes ==
* There are actually ''six'' variants of Ancient pot: three shapes/sizes (numbered 1 through 3), and two "colors" ("red" or "green"). Despite their names, each red variant is completely identical to its matching green variant (and vice-versa).

